{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_3_10008_01_k",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:02f8c2d93aa295e718fabb92f4920ef3a52266e130e5fe758de0eeac0a389134",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10008_01:1_3_10008_01_k:cmd-000020:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e",
      "text": "几天后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10008_01:1_3_10008_01_k:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:37308b948afd651f05ed5adba5c06eb288a220384a14923d8da65a00158fd020",
      "text": "（在各大媒体上，纪念表演赛和\n现场表演都收获了极高的评价）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10008_01:1_3_10008_01_k:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1b7d5907728c7835e0aae7460e044d1626800f2368a3333c586d516225da9eb9",
      "text": "（感觉THE 虎牙道的粉丝群体，\n又得到了大幅拓展呢）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10008_01:1_3_10008_01_k:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c4147fdc432896cfb84a16ea5c965ce8c1f0e35c3b387e6fe33452ef0a702537",
      "text": "可恶，这家伙……！\n怎么可能打得中啊！！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10008_01:1_3_10008_01_k:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b8451593b5a9b80777ea949e742c92049d4ac9ad6ffcaa8dce5c8904353daaa5",
      "text": "圆城寺先生果然厉害啊。\n跟我们的动作完全不是一个级别的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10008_01:1_3_10008_01_k:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8dd5eae50fed3aca9094fb75fd77c01298e4d903c2800a35c8237948dc624004",
      "text": "武是不是也比以前进步了？\n好，下一把用这个角色……嗯？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10008_01:1_3_10008_01_k:cmd-000084:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:54daacb86f30159f40ebeba88468e1f0ffbe3199020978a9d8dd8eef7ccc73da",
      "text": "差不多该去练习了吧！\n你们两个，等回来再继续打吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10008_01:1_3_10008_01_k:cmd-000089:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dc761eb5828524c102f38933aa3d822ed6d8b8202be1a28c5f29ef7348aac55a",
      "text": "嘁……\n你可别忘了啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10008_01:1_3_10008_01_k:cmd-000093:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:080ffb811ff9c9e5a69bbb807f689ab8d65779819ae4b3d9402068c122e7ced3",
      "text": "说起来，喜欢游戏的大吾先生和恭二先生，\n听说也看了大赛的转播呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10008_01:1_3_10008_01_k:cmd-000098:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ef6492cd8fb95639766829adc32faa66a95d8dc3bf9820d325f68805afc071c8",
      "text": "两个人都说想和THE 虎牙道的各位\n切磋切磋呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10008_01:1_3_10008_01_k:cmd-000107:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:56e107f5fdc29af74316beeae449333543992d58888dc03355c5b8c434470c8c",
      "text": "喔喔，挺好的嘛。\n我不管谁来挑战都会赢给你们看的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10008_01:1_3_10008_01_k:cmd-000119:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0da3fa3940c4ed243c2055e44093d4b45a5a55fec9643057af882ce0a94783f5",
      "text": "事务所的成员一起打游戏吗……挺让人期待的。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
